                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Hello, I'm Ruth"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "I left a newspaper job in Boston in 2019 for forty acres of hill farm and a dog who refuses to walk in the rain. The Long Field began as letters to friends about what I was learning, and slowly found more readers than I ever expected."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "I write about land, work and attention, and "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "I answer every reply.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "highlight"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
